{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1073093-movie-inspirations-for-geist-chronicles","id":1073093,"title":"Movie Inspirations for Geist Chronicles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-04T07:02:36-07:00","id":1073093,"title":"Movie Inspirations for Geist Chronicles","content":"So I am a HUGE Netflix binge watcher. I try to find inspiration in movies, plays, books,etc. for all game lines I run (specially Geist). So I was watched a movie called Abattoir and although not the best movie, the ideas behind it and the general plot was great enough to spark many ideas for a new chronicle of mine. So what movies (no matter what kind) have sparked some good ideas for Geist? <br /> <br /> Recent movies that have inspired my Chronicles (and WILL inspire my future Chronicles):<br /> <br /> 1. Abattoir<br /> 2. Destiny (silent film about death)<br /> 3. I am the Pretty Thing in the House<br /> 4. Chronicles of the Ghostly Tribe (The visions of the tribe at the archeological dig was insanely similar to how I picture certain areas of the Underworld)<br /> 5. The Veil<br /> 6. The Babadook (I crafted a Geist after this creature)<br /> 7. Darling<br /> 8. Day Watch and Night Watch (specifically 'the gloom' is what I picture twilight to be like).<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T19:06:53-07:00","id":1073978,"title":"","content":"Babbadock is a great idea for a geist, did you write anything about him down?<br /> <br /> The movie &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/What_Lies_Beneath\" target=\"_blank\">What Lies Beneath</a>&quot; and &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shutter_(2004_film)\" target=\"_blank\">Shutter</a>&quot;are good stories about ghosts out for revenge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2015,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2015-inspectorjavert","user":"inspectorjavert","date":". 04-05-2017, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2015-inspectorjavert","name":"inspectorjavert","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T14:24:35-07:00","id":1074315,"title":"","content":"Ah yes, I did write some info down, in fact I can post it later this evening if you'd like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","cu